  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Providing access to sexual and reproductive health and rights (SRHR) in the humanitarian crisis in east DRC.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Providing women and girls with access to life-saving sexual and reproductive health (SRHR) services through the delivery of a minimum service package of care is a minimum standard that the UK has committed to supporting, and represents value for money in terms of saving lives. British Embassy Kinshasa (BEK) sees that there is a critical gap in providing adequate SRSH services in the east of DRC as part of our humanitarian response.</narrative>
  </description>
